# Force LF line endings on checkout regardless of the cloning machine's
# core.autocrlf setting. Without this, Git for Windows' common default
# (autocrlf=true) rewrites shell scripts' shebang lines to "#!/bin/bash\r",
# which breaks exec inside the Linux container with a confusing
# "no such file or directory" error for a file that clearly exists.
* text=auto eol=lf
